{"id":"26ff54205c748daa","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions.md","title":"Hilbert-Bernays Derivability Conditions","display":"df-hilbert-bernays-conditions — Hilbert-Bernays Derivability Conditions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions","aliases":["57-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions"],"display":"df-hilbert-bernays-conditions — Hilbert-Bernays Derivability Conditions","depends_on":["[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-derivable]]","[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-provability-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hilbert-bernays-conditions — Hilbert-Bernays Derivability Conditions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d26264b420dc144\" href=\"?note=5d26264b420dc144\" title=\"57-df-derivable\">57-df-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"658bea3e76b250ff\" href=\"?note=658bea3e76b250ff\" title=\"57-df-provability-predicate\">57-df-provability-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(L\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 和固定选定的一元公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"658bea3e76b250ff\" href=\"?note=658bea3e76b250ff\" title=\"57-df-provability-predicate\">57-df-provability-predicate</a> 的同一实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 为标准一阶 Hilbert 推导；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})\\)</span> 中输入是闭数码而不是元层自然数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 在下式中为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-句子。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}_1(T),\\mathrm{HB}_2(T),\\mathrm{HB}_3(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}_1(T),\\mathrm{HB}_2(T),\\mathrm{HB}_3(T)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}(T)\\)</span> 是本原子定义的理论性质谓词，均相对上述固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_T\\)</span> 解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}_1(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\varphi\\to T\\vdash\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HB}_1(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\varphi\\to T\\vdash\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}_2(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\nT\\vdash\\left(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi\\to\\psi)})\\to\n(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})\\to\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\psi)}))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HB}_2(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\nT\\vdash\\left(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi\\to\\psi)})\\to\n(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})\\to\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\psi)}))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}_3(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\nT\\vdash\\left(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})\\to\n\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)}))})\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HB}_3(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\nT\\vdash\\left(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})\\to\n\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)}))})\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HB}_1(T)\\land\\mathrm{HB}_2(T)\\land\\mathrm{HB}_3(T),\\qquad\nD_1(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HB}_1(T),\\quad D_2(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HB}_2(T),\\quad D_3(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HB}_3(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HB}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HB}_1(T)\\land\\mathrm{HB}_2(T)\\land\\mathrm{HB}_3(T),\\qquad\nD_1(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HB}_1(T),\\quad D_2(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HB}_2(T),\\quad D_3(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HB}_3(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这三个条件是关于已选定的 Bew_T 的性质；不是对每个外延正确的可证性公式都自动成立的公理。HB_i 补齐后续文件实际调用的接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-derivable","status":"resolved","id":"5d26264b420dc144","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-derivable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"658bea3e76b250ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"658bea3e76b250ff","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$L\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$；$g$ 和固定选定的一元公式 $\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)$ 取 [[57-df-provability-predicate]] 的同一实例。$\\vdash$ 为标准一阶 Hilbert 推导；$\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})$ 中输入是闭数码而不是元层自然数。$\\varphi,\\psi$ 在下式中为 $L$-句子。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}_1(T),\\mathrm{HB}_2(T),\\mathrm{HB}_3(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bew}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}_1(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\varphi\\to T\\vdash\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}_2(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\nT\\vdash\\left(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi\\to\\psi)})\\to\n(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})\\to\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\psi)}))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}_3(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\nT\\vdash\\left(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)})\\to\n\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\underline{g(\\varphi)}))})\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HB}_1(T)\\land\\mathrm{HB}_2(T)\\land\\mathrm{HB}_3(T),\\qquad\nD_1(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HB}_1(T),\\quad D_2(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HB}_2(T),\\quad D_3(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HB}_3(T).","display":true}],"bytes":1996,"backlinks":[{"id":"8d03cb367dadda8f","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$Q\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}$，见 [[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]。$\\vdash$ 指 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶 Hilbert 推导；$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\bot=\\neg\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0)$。$\\mathrm{Con}(T)$ 取 [[57-df-consistency]]，并使用标准 Hilbert 与经典矢列演算的等价读法。固定 [[57-df-provability-predicate]] 的同一 $\\mathrm{Bew}_T$ 及其编码，$\\mathrm{RAx}(T)$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-axiomatizability]]；$\\mathrm{HB}_i(T)$ 取 [[57-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions]]。$\\mathrm{Con}_T$ 是下式定义的对象语言句子；元层谓词 $\\mathrm{Con}(T)$ 不被当成可放在 $\\vdash$ 右侧的公式。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"理论 $T$ 的可证性谓词（Bew = Beweis，德语\"证明\"），与 [[57-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions]] 一致"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[5